None of claude-seo's source is copied into this repository. bof/suite.py adds
its scripts directory to sys.path at import time and calls the following
functions, which is why claude-seo must be installed for anything here to run:

    render_page.render_page
    parse_html.parse_html
    url_safety.validate_url_strict, safe_requests_get,
                make_safe_playwright_route_handler
    agent_ux_check.analyze_html, analyze_accessibility_tree
    ucp_check.audit_site
    content_quality.analyse
    preload_check.analyse
    google_auth.get_api_key
    google_report.generate_report

bof/suite.py pins the tested version and bof/test_suite_contract.py asserts that
each of those functions still exists, still accepts the arguments passed to it,
and still returns the keys read from it. Run it after any claude-seo upgrade: a
silent signature change moves scores without failing anything else.

The bundled Chromium used for rendering and for PDF output also comes from
claude-seo's Playwright installation.
